 "version": "1.7.8",
 "changelog": "Meet Zoomii, your personal clicking assistant. The main window is now an assistant start screen with a big animated Zoomii, a Start Assistant button, and cards for Scans, Buttons Done and Run Time. The long floating bar is gone: a small Zoomii now sits anywhere on your screen, you can drag her wherever you like and she remembers her spot, and clicking her opens a small panel with Scans, Buttons Done, Pause and Stop. She reacts while she works: ready, working, a short success flash on every completed button, a little dance on every 5 buttons and on demand, and sleep after a quiet minute. The border around the screen while running is now yellow. Settings has a new Assistant Sound switch (off by default) for the sound of her clips. Everything else, scanning, holding, the stop shortcut and updates, works exactly as before.",
